{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dda9bba28dc7cd628104bb7f7f565a84dd4605264fee7065cb64681e07de8f83", "ja": "（この前、杏奈達の買い物に付き合ったけど……\nやっぱり杏奈の部屋には、ゲームが多かったな）", "zh": "（之前陪杏奈她们去买东西……\n杏奈的房间里真的有好多电玩呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "4e5cc1b97fcf19d311d15e32caf13065208d45d4641ae6aa8daaca7a0b0cebbe", "ja": "……{$P$}、さん……\nえっと……お仕事、忙しい……ですか……？", "zh": "……{$P$}，先生……\n那个……你正在，忙着……工作吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3454328eba12804fec3c567127da214440bbb4d4caf07fc78bdd002576ed9b56", "ja": "お、杏奈か。\n今終わったところだけど、何か用事か？", "zh": "哦，是杏奈啊。\n我工作正好结束了，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "3bea56f7da4fa5cd5e89fdd57699d22c882a061d9504e5aab025e3ca28b1573b", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん、は……\nお家でも、お仕事……してる……？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，你……\n在家里，也会……工作吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "f3df7f8de7306dc2f51a32dd1e679c47a60d5d2e5bcea81a3261af16cb9afbcb", "ja": "最近……ネトゲのチャットに、ログインしてない……\n……から……。杏奈……心配、です……。", "zh": "最近……你都没上，网游的聊天室……\n……所以……杏奈……非常，担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ab2ecfdb5307560eb7861222fad0c5b15d2fc1b8517b9decf68ab9e6efd959ef", "ja": "ああ、そういえばログインできてないな。\n最近は、家に帰るとすぐに眠気が……。", "zh": "对耶，我好像都没上线。\n最近一回到家就想睡觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "e101912043d9984bcc7ecabb3b1ca819292c58c6bcbf34f715833656a4312428", "ja": "{$P$}さんは……杏奈の、\nプロデューサーだけど……ネトゲでは、仲間……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……你虽然是杏奈的，\n制作人……但在游戏里面，是伙伴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "3f36461c82ae8a8c4c856f41bd2a12da72a3ca22b2c274902f7ede995c290ec3", "ja": "ゲームの中なら……体力も、魔力も……\n杏奈が、回復してあげられる……のに……。", "zh": "在游戏里面的话……不管是体力，还是魔力……\n杏奈，都可以帮你恢复……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0bbd9aa8a9c3a9a982e0fd056c8c5756e1f648b3f2b0023120c9b874cb3fff0a", "ja": "そうか……心配してくれてありがとう。\n杏奈がこうして気遣ってくれるだけで、元気になるよ。", "zh": "我懂了……谢谢你替我担心。\n杏奈，光是知道你这么关心我，我就有精神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "9990880c79a689c0c886c800fd036ca1f82d22ee52a9a55d956f659c054cea83", "ja": "……本当……？", "zh": "……真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4acbc5e76defb48be7faf83915dded969e7f342592410c56ad74d8940efe01cf", "ja": "ああ。俺の体力ゲージを見せてあげたいくらいだよ。\n今ので、すごく回復したからな！", "zh": "真的，我都想让你看看我的血条了。\n刚才那样帮我补了好多血啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "9737d6f19f8c1543acf08333d2e7c6c903e05fd939f4c40521e2cb1e3faaa3ae", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "c70abe0ce96807619089d37a9639a9bbe0f5ff4563a90e7711b119ec2c2e2a3b", "ja": "でも……やっぱり、ムリしちゃダメ、だから……。\n杏奈と、約束……して、ください……。", "zh": "不过……你还是，不可以，勉强自己……\n请你，和杏奈……一言，为定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9053b2bbf7379646248803666abf8c444fe095a6a40952a6aa8e1ec0c8927969", "ja": "ムリはしない、約束する。そうだな……\n今日は早めに帰って、久しぶりにログインしてみるよ。", "zh": "我向你保证，我不会勉强自己。不然这样吧……\n今天我就早点回家吧，好久没上线看看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0053_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "47a6458a5dfc7c01a290823e9de2a7a40c238c949947cddb3d808027233c9372", "ja": "ほんと、ですか……？　……やった♪\n……杏奈……楽しみに、してるね……♪", "zh": "真的，吗……？……太好了♪\n……杏奈……期待你，上线……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
